{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17side_level_act17side_st05",
  "groupId": "act17side",
  "stageId": "act17side_04",
  "title": "登陆点",
  "storyCode": "SN-ST-5",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st05.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b922361f2eabf19eb74b44a19181a7522efc699d7ff5a065c02f0e2b1eb4665a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "text": "哈......这些，恶心的地面，是怎么回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "text": "是这些恐鱼吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "蒂亚戈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "text": "......阿玛雅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "text": "怎么回事？这些深海教徒，你不是说他们不会出现吗？他们把这里弄得一团糟......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "蒂亚戈，我是来道别的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "时候差不多了，而现在机会难得，我只是这么觉得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "text": "我不明白......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "蒂亚戈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "审判官已经到了。足足三位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "乔迪在他们手上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "text": "唔——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "别急，蒂亚戈。乔迪是以自己的意志回到的这里。三名审判官，你能做些什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "text": "他知不知道被审判庭发现意味着什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "你说过很多次，我想他应该知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "但人就是这样。趋利避害只是逻辑推论得出的结果，人复杂得多，而这种复杂不能被轻易评判......我不会说乔迪愚蠢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "text": "现在可不是当道德家的时候——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "我们谈论的是性质，而非道德，蒂亚戈镇长。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "人之性具有美感。连时间都否定不了这一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "text": "......你到底要说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "你憎恨审判庭吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "text": "......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "恐鱼确实遍布小镇，但是，蒂亚戈，回忆一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "那个雨夜，那些惩戒军，他们闯入镇上，撕碎房门。惨叫不绝于耳，盖过淅沥沥的雨点......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "text": "不，别说了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "——现在呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "海的痕迹蔓延在这座小镇上——你听见惨叫了吗？你看到无理由的杀戮或狩猎了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亚戈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "现在的格兰法洛——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "text": "——徒留静谧而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "海洋原来，这么广阔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "海风吹过。\n乔迪不可置信地看着眼前的一切。他本以为海平线就是天空的终点。\n直到亲眼确认这无限延伸的浪潮时——乔迪——这个阿戈尔人突然产生了一个疑惑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "为什么人类从来没有过探索它的欲望呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "......除非星星是有规律的地图，或者双月能变成信号塔，否则我们怎么才能在这一片汪洋上确认方位？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "呃，星星是没有规律的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "去问专业的天文学家好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "那如果......阿戈尔真的在海面以下，那阿戈尔究竟有多大......比伊比利亚还要大吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "那边有几个真正的阿戈尔人，你要不要去问问看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "她们好像都有心事的样子，一脸严肃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "鲨鱼，你在听什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "......风。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "海风中夹杂着亲缘的馈赠，让我......很安心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "越接近海洋，她越是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "在盐风城的时候她明明......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你知道原因吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "我的猜测只会干扰你的判断，我们的眼前是战斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "侥幸上岸之后，你有试过回到海洋吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "当然，然后失败了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "它们无穷无尽，包围着我，我只是游出去没多远就失去了力气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我试了很多很多次......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "但是你还活着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "我们都清楚我们自己身上发生的变化，斯卡蒂。你也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "鲨鱼虽然遭受了一些伤害，但她是我的猎人，她才不会那么脆弱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "她与我们是一样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "“幽灵鲨”，曾是深海教会的受害者。源石，这种东西不存在于海洋，对她产生了各种影响。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "为何要带着这样的不确定因素？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "我们回家，与你无关。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "家？但是阿戈尔的情况不会比伊比利亚好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "提起你的灯，审判官。先准备迎接敌人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "唔，它们来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "最后一个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "深海猎人真只有三人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "如果还有别人，我早该找到他们才是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "......为什么这么问？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "突然出现的恐鱼",
      "text": "（诡异的窸窣声）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "航向准确吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "无误。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "......靠近伊比利亚之眼后，恐鱼展现出了更明确的敌意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "那里兴许已是它们的巢穴，在船上缠斗实在浪费时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "斯卡蒂，鲨鱼，你们保护这艘船，也顺便看着点那些原始的信号导航设备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "我去海里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我和你一起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "你在海里更强，但它们也是。而且我们不能在海里流血，那太危险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "怎、怎么了？！又有怪物袭击了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "不，看不见！我们不知道水下发生了什么，但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "沉闷的轰鸣......！下面发生了什么？她在下面战斗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "她只是在......移动。毕竟在水里，她更快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "......在水里怎么可能比在空气中速度还快......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "习惯吧，或者是技巧一类的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "恐鱼随她去了。她开辟了一条道路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "艾丽妮，你带着布雷奥甘的后裔继续掌舵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "速度快，在敌人包围我们之前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "他们已经出发了，海上不会平静。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "text": "如果担心他们，我们就赶紧完成我们的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "text": "格兰法洛本就是收复灯塔的前哨，我们要做的只是重拾这一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "伊比利亚竟然已经能够利用阿戈尔的技术抵御溟痕的入侵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "text": "它们进化的速度快过任何一位科学家的大脑，要赢，就要不择手段。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "哪怕动用了一支军队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "text": "......这是座不起眼的小镇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "text": "也许有更多的战略重地等着审判庭一一收复。更好的作战地点，更宏伟的高墙与碉堡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "text": "但，有时候，从手边事做起，也不是什么坏事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "text": "有多少伊比利亚人愿意与浪潮厮杀至死，我们就有多少人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "text": "现在，开始扫除吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "text": "（持续的窸窣声）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "喂......我们还没到吗？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "按、按照海图，我们至少已经能看见它了才对啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "长官！再深入下去，恐怕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "抬头看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "什么？明明黑漆漆一片，我什么都......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "不......那不是......那不是天空，那是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "那里已是它们的巢穴。离海岸很近，难怪那些恐鱼数量如此之多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "砍完就可以了吧。像以前那样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "......对，像以前那样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "鲨鱼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "那就是......他们的眼睛？为什么我能感觉到如此熟悉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "它蒙于污秽许久，早已睁不开眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "我来开路。乔迪，你跟我们走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "啊。好、好......希望我能帮上忙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "不，是你必须要做到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "否则，我们会转变战略，优先确保审判庭的技术人员能安全抵达这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "在这场战役中，我们无暇顾及一个自说自话的阿戈尔人的死活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "你似乎很着急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "阿戈尔人。你不明白重新抵达这座岛屿的意义。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "意义？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "......从惩戒军发现灯塔残存的讯号至今，我们十七次试图登陆这里，其中有八次成功踩上这片礁石。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "数百名战士，三位审判官，没有人活着回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "难道阿戈尔的优越道德，教你们放弃对英雄的尊重与缅怀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "长官和我......伊比利亚人会为那些葬身大海的亡魂祭奠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "我无意对你们的道德挑三拣四。只是，面对海洋，我们势单力薄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "请便吧，但我们时间紧迫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "踏上礁石。\n巨物躲藏在漆黑的风中，只有抬头凝视，才能从一片昏沉的天空里将它分辨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伊比利亚之眼。\n一双紧闭的眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "......好高......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "那座小镇上的雕塑，比例尺一定标错了吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "......长官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "这就是，我们曾经的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "我也是，第一次亲眼目睹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "二人无言片刻，驻足打量着这仅存于文献与记录中的恢宏景象。\n伊比利亚坚韧的现实仍旧超过她被教育的那般，艾丽妮如此想到。尽管那些深海猎人对他们满怀不屑，尽管国家的平衡确实在崩溃。\n但这座灯塔就像是一个象征。关于过去的风声与野心。关于欲望与对未知的桀骜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "无论你此刻心中翻涌着什么情感，铭记它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "这些建筑，这些破损的剑与灯，这些礁石，这片海洋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "要把人类究竟在斗争中建立了什么铭记在心，时时刻刻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "若不敬畏牺牲，天秤则无意义。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "小心前进吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你在做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "我们回家了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "不，还没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "但如果我们在这里找到了凯尔希和二队长要找的，也许可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "忍耐一下吧......就快了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "这里太安静了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "明明都是恶臭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "是，礁石上满是溟痕的残留，能看见一些人造物的痕迹，大都腐朽了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌蕾蒂娅缓步轻踱，抬首望向延伸向昏黑天空的高塔。\n伊比利亚之眼向天指去，就好像在这有限的土地上，生命伸长脖颈，想看见未来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "陆上诸国竭尽全力复制出了布雷奥甘留下的遗产，这些所谓灯塔，尽是对阿戈尔技术的模仿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "在这空无一物的大海上，这座灯塔又在等着什么呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "它究竟是看着海洋，还是看着陆地呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "二队长。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "我知道。这里本就是恐鱼的巢穴，它们没有立刻出现，也许只是一种防御性的护巢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "它们也该来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "text": "（诡异的窸窣声）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "数量......不算多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "海，这里已经看不见海岸了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "怀念吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "不......只是在说，我们不能流血。在这里，会很危险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "它们还刺不穿我们的肌肤。只要不停下你的舞步，这些数量，还不足以杀死我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "（灯塔......果然和小镇上那座雕像一模一样。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "（也就是说，家里的那些图纸，确实是爸妈留下的伊比利亚之眼的......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "（我的父母曾经......就是在这里......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "乔迪回头望向海洋。\n每一天，他都会回想起自己所见到的那片灰蒙蒙的海岸。没有活力的颜色，没有希望的人群。\n可是，啊，看看这座灯塔吧，乔迪这么想到。\n蒂亚戈叔叔说得对，他们都是英雄，他们本该伟大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "......深海猎人们应该就在不远处休整，她们也会参与战斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "别忘了在盐风城所见到的，她们的血很特殊，凯尔希并没有向审判庭全盘托出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "明、明白，所以她们是不能信任的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "你在审判庭地下看到了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "——呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "“海嗣”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "你应当还记得它的扭曲，它的生命力，它的......平静。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "在盐风城，她们曾与那样的怪物为敌，并获得胜利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "我......我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "你已经见过真相了，那就重新审视你的过去和伊比利亚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "撕毁脑海里的旧景！得出你自己的判决。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "是、是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "text": "——（摩擦礁石的窸窣声）——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "它们已经准备好了。退守巢穴，伺机而动，现在来驱赶外敌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "乔迪，情况如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "是、是！真是奇迹，外面这些控制面板还有反应，但我不清楚这些东西的驱动原理是什么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "我、我在找！我包里带着家里的那些研究笔记！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官达里奥",
      "text": "......动作快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乔迪",
      "text": "知道！是这本......不、不对......咿，这本怎么被弄湿了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "text": "长官！它们来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "波涛汹涌。\n水面掀起数十米高的傲慢，日复一日地破碎，屈服于礁石与三个月亮。\n一个月亮明亮。一个月亮晦暗。这是亘古的月亮，挂在天上。\n剩下一轮月色，来自海浪的间隙，浪峰的顶端。\n月光来自他曾信仰的名号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
